    <ns1:identifierSumber>Environmental conditions, paragraph 1</ns1:identifierSumber>
    <ns1:kutipanSumber>Bacterial wilt of potato is generally favoured by temperatures between 25°C and 37°C. It usually doesn't cause problems in areas where mean soil temperature is below 15°C.</ns1:kutipanSumber>
