    <ns1:dokumenSumber>SRC_EXT_039</ns1:dokumenSumber>
    <ns1:identifierSumber>Results 3.2 Whitefly Survey</ns1:identifierSumber>
    <ns1:kutipanSumber>No whiteflies could be collected from four sites because no insects were found infesting soybean (Itai, Piraju, Santa Cruz do Rio Pardo, and Taquarituba) probably due to the rainy weather.</ns1:kutipanSumber>
