    <ns1:identifierSumber>Abstract, same sentence as temperature</ns1:identifierSumber>
    <ns1:kutipanSumber>Disease development is strongly associated with temperatures of 26–30 °C, high relative humidity, and prolonged leaf wetness, conditions commonly observed during the rainy season in tropical agroecosystems.</ns1:kutipanSumber>
