    <ns1:identifierSumber>Southern blight disease development</ns1:identifierSumber>
    <ns1:kutipanSumber>In addition to temperature effects, hyphal growth and sclerotia germination require a water-saturated soil. High humidity also favors fungal development.</ns1:kutipanSumber>
